From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kcms/users: FingerprintDialog: no flatFooterButtons
Description:
 The port from Kirigami.Dialog to QQC2.Dialog kept the binding of the
 footer buttons to flatFooterButtons, a property of Kirigami.Dialog only.
 Every footer button logged "Unable to assign [undefined] to bool"; the
 buttons are not flat either way.
Forwarded: no
License: LGPL-2.1-only OR LGPL-3.0-only OR LicenseRef-KDE-Accepted-LGPL (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
---
--- a/kcms/users/src/ui/FingerprintDialog.qml
+++ b/kcms/users/src/ui/FingerprintDialog.qml
@@ -69,7 +69,6 @@
             delegate: QQC2.Button {
                 required property Kirigami.Action modelData
 
-                flat: root.flatFooterButtons
                 action: modelData
             }
         }
